sequenceDiagram

actor Rep as Provider representative
participant Server as server.js
participant Route as routes/provider.js + guards + validation
participant C as controllers/providers.js
participant M as Provider / ProviderApplication
participant DB as MongoDB
Rep->>Server: POST /api/v1/provider/applications
Server->>Route: Parsed JSON
Route->>Route: Authenticate provider, validate ProfileInput
Route->>C: submitApplication(req.actor, req.validated)
activate C
C->>DB: Start transaction
C->>M: Guard owned non-suspended Provider via revision increment
M->>DB: Find/update provider with session
C->>M: Check pending application exists
M->>DB: Read provider-scoped pending version
alt A pending version exists
    C->>DB: Abort transaction
    C-->>Server: next(AppError 409)
else No pending version
    C->>M: Save new version = applicationSequence + 1
    M->>DB: Insert immutable application in session
    C->>M: Set latestApplicationId, increment sequence
    Note over C,M: Keep approvedApplicationId, only set pending when no approved profile
    M->>DB: Update provider in same session
    DB-->>C: Commit
    C-->>Server: 201 serialized application
end
deactivate C
Server-->>Rep: Success or safe JSON error
